const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"真实价值不只体现在指数涨跌",en:"Real value is more than an index's return"},body:{zh:"论文关心股票市场能否汇集有关企业未来盈利的信息，以及这些信息是否有助于投资配置。价格能预测未来盈利，与管理者从价格学到额外信息是两个问题。即使一个市场波动很大，也不能只据波动就判断它没有信息功能或资本配置作用。",en:"The paper asks whether prices aggregate information about future profits and whether that information helps allocate investment. Forecasting profits and revealing information beyond managers' private knowledge are distinct questions. High market volatility alone cannot establish the absence of either informational or allocative value."},reference:{url:"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~jcarpen0/pdfs/Carpenter%20Lu%20Whitelaw%20-%20The%20Real%20Value%20of%20China%27s%20Stock%20Market.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2021年期刊版，第680–681页",en:"Source: 2021 journal article, pp. 680–681"}}},{title:{zh:"信息含量不是简单的市场相关性",en:"Informativeness is not simply market correlation"},body:{zh:"作者按年做横截面回归，用当前估值和盈利等解释未来盈利，再结合估值分散度衡量预测变化。这个指标不同于股票对市场回归的拟合度。特质波动可能同时包含信息和噪声，所以不能把“与大盘走势不同”直接解释为价格包含更多可靠信息。",en:"Annual cross-sectional regressions relate future profits to current valuations and profitability, combining a coefficient with valuation dispersion to measure predicted variation. This differs from a stock's market-model fit. Idiosyncratic variation can contain news and noise, so moving differently from the market does not automatically imply more reliable information."},reference:{url:"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~jcarpen0/pdfs/Carpenter%20Lu%20Whitelaw%20-%20The%20Real%20Value%20of%20China%27s%20Stock%20Market.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2021年期刊版，第681页",en:"Source: 2021 journal article, pp. 681"}}},{title:{zh:"市值并非仅用流通A股计算",en:"Market value is not just tradable A-share capitalization"},body:{zh:"研究使用CSMAR的1995至2016年财务与行情资料，按年末A股价格乘以总股数构造市值，股数包括可交易A、B、H股及非流通股。这个特定口径不同于流通市值。若改用数据平台现成的市值字段，必须核对覆盖哪些股份类别。",en:"Using 1995–2016 CSMAR data, market value is year-end A-share price multiplied by total shares, including tradable A, B and H shares and nontradable shares. This is a specific convention, not free-float capitalization. A ready-made market-value field must be checked for which share classes it covers."},reference:{url:"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~jcarpen0/pdfs/Carpenter%20Lu%20Whitelaw%20-%20The%20Real%20Value%20of%20China%27s%20Stock%20Market.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2021年期刊版，第682页",en:"Source: 2021 journal article, pp. 682"}}},{title:{zh:"价格、投资与盈利构成三组关系",en:"Prices, investment and profits form three tests"},body:{zh:"论文分别研究价格对未来盈利、价格对未来投资，以及投资对未来盈利的预测关系，投资以资本开支衡量。三组结果之间的联系依赖管理者追求价值最大化并从价格学习等假设。它们共同提供解释线索，但不是同一个回归，也不能相互替代。",en:"Separate tests connect prices to future profits, prices to future investment, and investment to future profits, with capital expenditure measuring investment. Connections among them rely on assumptions about value-maximizing managers and learning from prices. They provide related evidence but are not interchangeable regressions."},reference:{url:"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~jcarpen0/pdfs/Carpenter%20Lu%20Whitelaw%20-%20The%20Real%20Value%20of%20China%27s%20Stock%20Market.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2021年期刊版，第681–682页",en:"Source: 2021 journal article, pp. 681–682"}}},{title:{zh:"国有股权比例影响比较方式",en:"State ownership changes the comparison"},body:{zh:"股权资料来自Wind，研究既允许系数随国有股权比例变化，也按40%的界限进行分组。国有企业可能承担盈利之外的目标，因而价值最大化假设的适用性不同。这个历史分组是论文的研究设计，不能当成所有场景通用的企业治理分类。",en:"Wind ownership data support coefficients varying with the state-owned equity fraction and a separate 40% split. State enterprises may pursue objectives beyond profit, changing the applicability of value-maximization assumptions. The historical grouping is a research design choice, not a universal corporate-governance classification."},reference:{url:"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~jcarpen0/pdfs/Carpenter%20Lu%20Whitelaw%20-%20The%20Real%20Value%20of%20China%27s%20Stock%20Market.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2021年期刊版，第682页",en:"Source: 2021 journal article, pp. 682"}}},{title:{zh:"信息改善不等于未来回报保证",en:"Better information does not promise future returns"},body:{zh:"作者还讨论资本成本，并提醒用历史实现回报估计必要回报会受到意外市场表现影响。价格信息含量改善也不意味着投资者可以轻易取得超额收益。阅读结论时应区分市场的信息作用、企业融资成本和投资者回报这三种含义。",en:"The capital-cost discussion warns that realized returns used to estimate required returns may reflect unexpected market performance. Improved price informativeness does not promise easily attainable excess returns. Keep the market's information function, firms' financing costs and investors' realized outcomes separate."},reference:{url:"https://pages.stern.nyu.edu/~jcarpen0/pdfs/Carpenter%20Lu%20Whitelaw%20-%20The%20Real%20Value%20of%20China%27s%20Stock%20Market.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2021年期刊版，第680–682页",en:"Source: 2021 journal article, pp. 680–682"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"研究覆盖1995至2016年，区分价格信息、投资配置与资本成本。历史实现收益不等于预期收益，制度变化同期发生也不单独证明改革的因果效应。",en:"The 1995–2016 study separates price information, capital allocation and capital costs. Realized historical returns need not equal expected returns, and coincident institutional reforms do not alone establish a causal reform effect."}};export{e as default};
